The correct Google Classroom rubric format (v1.0-s) should be:
1.  Header Warning
2.  Version (`v1.0-s`)
3.  First Criterion Title (Immediately following version, **no** assignment title row)
4.  First Criterion Description
5.  Points
6.  Level Titles
7.  Level Descriptions

